description.narrative:
The project aims to strengthen and disseminate the International Advocacy Network (RAI) in Brazil. RAI is a network coordinated by the Institute for Development and Human Rights (IDDH) that aims to increase the number of human rights defenders and strengthen civic space in Brazil through training, articulation and advocacy in international human rights mechanisms of the United Nations.
  Expected results:
1. Strengthening, dissemination and expansion of RAI;
2. Organization of international incidences by RAI;
3. Wide dissemination of information on international advocacy and HD
